# Ignore everything the Dockerfile doesn't need at build context time.
# The Dockerfile uses `bench get-app` to pull the LMS source from GitHub inside
# the image, so the local source tree doesn't need to be uploaded — only the
# entrypoint script + railway.toml.

.git
.github
cypress
frontend
frappe-ui
lms
node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
**/.venv
**/venv
docker
docs
*.md
!DEPLOY.md
